/T (The Chair presides as Vice President of the Senate and votesonly to break a tie, the Co-Chair presides as President pro tempore only when the Chair is absent, otherwise voting as a regular delegate. Resolutions pass on a floor vote alone, with a cloture threshold \(currently being finalized\) required to close debate before any final vote is taken. The conference runs across two days and eight working sessions in total. )
/E (The Chair presides as Vice President of the Senate and votesonly to break a tie, the Co-Chair presides as President pro tempore only when the Chair is absent, otherwise voting as a regular delegate. Resolutions pass on a floor vote alone, with a cloture threshold \(currently being finalized\) required to close debate before any final vote is taken. The conference runs across two days and eight working sessions in total. )
